    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -727,
      "init": {
        "label": "Cards from files",
        "body": "# Files to cards\nLocal File nodes read three CSV files from the demo vault's **Data** folder: crew, products and orders. Table verbs run on them.\n\nOrders join a product lookup on SKU and a rep lookup on the rep's full name, and a Keep picks the fields an order card needs.\n\nOpen any Frame chip and switch the popup to **Cards**. The photos and product pictures are `data:image` cells.\n\n**Record: Cards** draws the same cards as a chart, in the Catalog display below.\n\nOn desktop, point **Settings ▸ Data** at your own folder to read your own files.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crew",
      "type": "LocalFileNode",
      "x": 341,
      "y": 1606,
